Third-party material

ACP integration portions

Portions of the ACP catalogue, launch settings, program discovery, startup
handling and credential probing were adapted from Apache-2.0-licensed sources:
Copyright 2026 Untrivial
Upstream revision: 5525713f686b31c885f6afcdfd3aad31eb49d03e

These portions are in src/shared/agentCatalog.ts and
src/main/agents/{catalogDrivers,catalogDetect,signInProbes,acp}.ts.
They were modified for Foreman's TypeScript runtime, per-turn state,
credential reporting and permission policies. The original license and
copyright notice are retained in docs/licenses/acp-integration.txt.

Workspace names catalogue

The workspace names catalogue in src/shared/workspacePeople.json includes
excerpts and adaptations from English Wikipedia. That Wikipedia-derived
text remains available under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Individual entries link to their source articles and revision histories,
which identify their contributors. Changes and attribution details are
documented in docs/workspace-names.md.

The candidate discovery list used to build the catalogue draws on
AgeDataset by Issa Annamoradnejad and Rahimberdi Annamoradnejad (2022),
"Age dataset: A structured general-purpose dataset on life, work, and death
of 1.22 million distinguished people", https://doi.org/10.36190/2022.82,
https://github.com/Moradnejad/AgeDataset, under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

